meta {
  name: Melbourne Weather
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/weather
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
}

docs {
  `GET /weather`

  Legacy endpoint. Fetches weather for Melbourne (`Constants.DEFAULT_CITY_ID`,
  city ID `7839805`) in metric units.

  It has **no caching** - every call hits OpenWeatherMap and spends quota, which
  is why it sits in the stricter `uncached` rate-limit bucket. Do not use it for
  load or smoke testing.

  It sends no email. The daily Melbourne digest email comes from the `Scheduler`
  hosted service (22:00 UTC), not from this endpoint.
}
